## =============================================================================
## 08_cellchat.R
##
## CellChat inference of neuron <-> OLLC communication, run per sample, and
## paired euploid (OLLC_2) vs trisomic (OLLC_3) comparisons across the six
## matched cell line x technology pairs.
##
## Input : final annotated object from 04 (day150_final_annotated_seurat.rds)
##         integrated OLLC object from 04 (ollc_integrated.rds)
## Steps
##   1. Cell labels: OLLCs = OLLC subclusters (ollc_0 - ollc_5); neurons:
##        Mature ExN   (clusters 0, 1, 3, 6, 11, 13, 15)
##        Immature ExN (clusters 8, 9, 17)
##        Mature InN   (clusters 19, 20)
##        Immature InN (cluster 18)
##   2. CellChat per sample (CellChatDB.human, full database; log-normalized
##      RNA; population.size = FALSE; groups with < 3 cells excluded)
##   3. Discrepancy plots: LR interaction count and total communication
##      strength, neuron <-> OLLC_2 (euploid) / OLLC_3 (trisomic); medians
##      across matched pairs for interactions with the same direction of
##      difference in at least half of the matched pairs
##   4. Paired pathway log2FC (OLLC_3 / OLLC_2; pseudocount 1e-6), consensus
##      across matched pairs (same direction in >= 3 pairs), pathway heatmaps
##   5. Circle plots: median pathway probability across matched pairs
##   6. L-R bubble plots for selected consensus pathways
## =============================================================================

